          "source_text_sha256": "c482da48e17cf5b762c1484b282904b0b237b0b483a16f918e62799129d7f476",
          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the passage of a white, round PAN silently moving on a straight trajectory: observation of a Cessna 750 Citation X type aircraft.",
